  <h1 class="page-title">Sweepstakes Casino Gift Card Redemptions</h1>
  <p class="lede">Gift cards can suit smaller or retail-focused redemptions, but are not equivalent to unrestricted cash.</p>
  <div class="answer-first"><span class="af-label">Direct answer</span><p>Chumba and WOW Vegas publish separate gift-card and cash minimums. Pulsz has a gift-card help page, but its current product scope needs clarification against its general terms. Compare the current source-linked amounts below.</p></div>

